  n616461707465722d72756e6e6572["Run one configured attempt
Program step - fixed rules | EXISTING
Launch caller-selected executable arguments without a shell; retain raw receipts and cache successful results."]
  n63616c6c65722d6d6f64656c["Caller model operation
Model call - one bounded task | UNCERTAIN
Caller supplies a bounded inference adapter that returns exact response text and identity evidence; provider execution and isolation are outside this package."]
  n65786163742d7265736f6c766572["Resolve exact turn starts
